# Skill Auto-Invocation

Spec: SkillAutoInvocation
Purpose:
  Automatically invoke skills based on task context without manual trigger.
  Reduces friction by loading relevant skills before execution begins.

Owns: agent/skill-auto-invoke.sdd

Context Detection:
  Keywords by domain:
    FrontEnd:  ["frontend", "react", "vue", "angular", "ui", "ux", "component", "style", "page", "screen"]
    Backend:   ["api", "endpoint", "database", "server", "backend", "microservice"]
    Database:  ["migration", "schema", "query", "database", "sql"]
    DevOps:    ["deploy", "docker", "kubernetes", "ci", "cd", "infrastructure"]
    Design:    ["design", "ui", "ux", "visual", "taste", "aesthetic", "accessibility", "mobile"]
    Testing:   ["test", "e2e", "unit", "integration", "coverage"]
    Security:  ["security", "auth", "vulnerability", "audit", "compliance"]

Trigger Rules:
  [AI-01] Auto-invoke when domain keyword confidence >= 80%.
  [AI-02] Auto-invoke MUST NOT block execution.
  [AI-03] Auto-invoke results are advisory, not blocking.
  [AI-04] Manual override via /sdd-design --manual disables auto-invoke for current task.
  [AI-05] Auto-invoke MUST respect skill trust level and autonomy level.

Skill Resolution:
  1. Analyze task description, file paths, tool inputs
  2. Match keywords to skill domains
  3. Calculate confidence score
  4. If confidence >= 80%: load skill context
  5. If multiple domains: load all matching skills
  6. If no match: proceed without auto-invocation
  7. DESIGN DOMAIN SPECIAL RULE: if Design domain matches, load the
     Unified Design Intelligence module FIRST
     (@../skills/design/intelligence/INDEX.sdd) — it orchestrates the
     individual design skills; individual skills load through it.
     UI generation without the pipeline is BLOCKED ([D7]).

Output:
  AutoInvokeResult:
    invoked: boolean
    skills: [skill IDs]
    confidence: number
    context: compiled skill context

Navigation:
  Parent: @INDEX.sdd
  Commands: @../commands/sdd-design.sdd
  Skills: @../skills/INDEX.sdd
  DesignSkills: @../skills/design/INDEX.sdd
  DesignIntelligence: @../skills/design/intelligence/INDEX.sdd
